1, "text": "The same exchange repeated: White's D4 at move 50 lost 11.3 points, taking the lead to +25.6, and E3 lost 11.3 right back, to +14.3. Both of Opus 5.5's blunders came in this trade, and the lead at +14.3 matched the pre-exchange figure."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py parses the nine board rows from stdin and flood-fills each group to print its stones and liberty count, flagging groups with two or fewer liberties. It only inspects the current position and never proposes, scores or looks ahead at moves, and the single run's output is just group listings.", "stop": false}}